---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LogoMarquee from '../components/LogoMarquee.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Shape from '../components/blocks/Shape.astro';
import Testimonials from '../components/Testimonials.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img1De7cab32 from '../assets/images/1-de7cab32.png';
import img1Eaba97b2 from '../assets/images/1-eaba97b2.png';
import img2F2f249dd from '../assets/images/2-f2f249dd.png';
import img28 from '../assets/images/28.png';
import img3 from '../assets/images/3.png';
import img37 from '../assets/images/37.png';
import img4 from '../assets/images/4.png';
import img43 from '../assets/images/43.png';
import img44 from '../assets/images/44.png';
import img47 from '../assets/images/47.png';
import img8 from '../assets/images/8.png';
import blueIvoryPurpleCorners from '../assets/images/blue-ivory-purple-corners.png';
import conversationInBrightRoom from '../assets/images/conversation-in-bright-room.png';
import forbesAdvisor from '../assets/images/forbes-advisor.png';
import gradient4e63635d from '../assets/images/gradient-4e63635d.png';
import jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios107 from '../assets/images/jphelloseoheadshots0626-staborstudios-107.jpg';
import jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios37 from '../assets/images/jphelloseoheadshots0626-staborstudios-37.jpg';
import jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios68 from '../assets/images/jphelloseoheadshots0626-staborstudios-68.jpg';
import majestic from '../assets/images/majestic.png';
import moz from '../assets/images/moz.png';
import pattern1 from '../assets/images/pattern-1.png';
import pexelsPavelDanilyuk7653084 from '../assets/images/pexels-pavel-danilyuk-7653084.jpg';
import pexelsTimurWeber8559997 from '../assets/images/pexels-timur-weber-8559997.jpg';
import seoFomo from '../assets/images/seo-fomo.png';
import sitebulb from '../assets/images/sitebulb.png';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
import vktr from '../assets/images/vktr.png';
import womenInTechSeo from '../assets/images/women-in-tech-seo.png';
---

<Layout title="SEO and AEO for Therapists | HelloSEO" description="HelloSEO specializes in SEO and AEO services tailored for growing therapy practices, helping you attract aligned clients and expand your reach effectively." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} footerOffset="2vw">
  <Section bg={{ src: pattern1, overlay: 0.15, parallax: true, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [50, 25], rowGap: 0, colGap: 30 }}>
    <Text m="4/2/7/10" d="4/8/6/20" z={1} align="end" alignM="start">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>SEO &amp; AEO FOR THERAPISTS</strong></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="7/2/20/10" d="7/8/17/20" z={3} zm={2}>
      <h1 class="ta-center">Fill your caseload with <span class="c-lightAccent">ideal clients</span> the moment they seek your support.</h1>
      <p class="large ta-center">We use proven search strategies created specifically for therapists to ensure the clients you want find you, <em>first</em>.&nbsp;</p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="21/3/23/9" d="18/11/20/17" z={5} zm={4} align="center" href="/contact">Get started</Button>
    <Img m="25/2/33/6" d="3/3/14/7" z={8} zm={7} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'appear', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ y: '75px' }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={conversationInBrightRoom} alt="A man and woman having a conversation in a cozy, well-lit living room with large windows and green plants." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 17vw" eager />
    <Img m="25/6/33/10" d="12/2/24/6" z={7} zm={6} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'appear', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ y: '-40px' }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={img8} alt="A woman with an afro hairstyle wearing an orange sweater and teal pants sitting on a brown leather tufted sofa, working on a laptop in a cozy room with wooden flooring, a potted plant, and a bulletin board on the wall." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 17vw" eager />
    <Img m="34/2/49/10" d="8/21/24/26" z={7} zm={6} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'appear', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ x: '179px' }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios107} alt="A woman with long wavy brown hair, wearing a dark button-up shirt, gold jewelry, and hoop earrings, smiling against a plain light background." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" eager />
  </Section>

  <Section theme="dark" grid={{ rows: [2, 2], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="2/4/3/24" z={1} alignM="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>AS SEEN IN:</strong></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <LogoMarquee theme="dark" padding={[2, 2]}
    logos={[
      { src: img3, alt: 'Black and white logo with the word "ENTREPRENISTA" in bold, stylized capital letters.' },
      { src: forbesAdvisor, alt: 'Empty white background with no visible objects or details.' },
      { src: majestic, alt: 'Majestic logo with five stars above the word \'Majestic\' in bold letters' },
      { src: moz, alt: 'The logo of Moz, a digital marketing analytics company, with the word \'Moz\' in white letters on a black background.' },
      { src: img2F2f249dd, alt: 'PressHook logo with stylized text' },
      { src: seoFomo, alt: 'A stylized rocket ship with stars and sparkles, above the text \'SEOFOMO\' in bold letters.' },
      { src: sitebulb, alt: 'Sitebul logo with a stylized code icon and the company name in white on a black background.' },
      { src: img4, alt: 'Logo of The AI Journal in black and white' },
      { src: vktr, alt: 'Black background with white text displaying the letters \'VKTR\' in a stacked arrangement.' },
      { src: img1Eaba97b2, alt: 'Logo with the text "VODKROT" in stylized font' },
      { src: womenInTechSeo, alt: 'Text reading \'Women in Tech SEO\' with a diagonal slash' }
    ]}
  />

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [33, 23], rowGap: 18, colGap: 20 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/5/10" d="1/7/4/21" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-black">For Therapists, Search is the </span><span class="c-lightAccent"><em>#1 Marketing Strategy</em></span><span class="c-black"> to Gain Aligned Clients.</span></h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="5/2/10/10" d="4/8/6/20" z={4} align="center" alignM="start">
      <p class="large ta-center">Finding the right therapist can be a lonely pursuit. Most clients don't trust social media to find a partner for something so personal, and the idea of asking friends or family for a referral often feels too vulnerable.</p>
    </Text>
    <Img m="15/2/20/6" d="7/19/18/24" z={7} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'scroll', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-in-out-back', frames: [{}, { r: 5 }], until: 'cover 50%' }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #b37793', radius: '14px' }} src={pexelsPavelDanilyuk7653084} alt="A woman in a white coat, presumably a doctor, consulting with a young girl and another woman in a cozy living room with a white brick wall. The doctor is taking notes, the girl is seated between the women, and they are all engaged in conversation. There are cushions on the sofa, a white table with some papers, and a floor lamp near a large window with curtains." radius="10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 21vw" />
    <Img m="15/6/20/10" d="7/14/18/19" z={4} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'scroll', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-in-out-back', frames: [{}, { r: -5 }], until: 'cover 50%' }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #b37793', radius: '14px' }} src={img28} alt="A young woman with dark hair, smiling broadly with her eyes closed, standing outdoors with blurred trees in the background." radius="10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 21vw" />
    <Img m="10/6/15/10" d="7/9/18/14" z={6} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'scroll', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-in-out-back', frames: [{}, { r: 5 }], until: 'cover 50%' }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #b37793', radius: '14px' }} src={pexelsTimurWeber8559997} alt="A group of four people engaged in a discussion in a bright room, with a woman in a white sleeveless shirt and a man in a blue shirt gesturing as they speak. There is a large green plant in the background." radius="10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 21vw" />
    <Img m="10/2/15/6" d="7/4/18/9" z={6} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'scroll', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-in-out-back', frames: [{}, { r: -5 }], until: 'cover 50%' }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #b37793', radius: '14px' }} src={img37} alt="Man with glasses talking on a yellow smartphone, wearing a beige shirt, white t-shirt, bracelet, and watch." radius="10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="21/2/28/10" d="19/4/24/13" z={3}>
      <p><span class="c-darkAccent">Instead, your potential clients wait until they’re in the comfort of their own homes to <strong>run a quick search on Google or ChatGPT</strong> and cross their fingers that it matches them with the perfect practitioner.</span></p>
      <p><span class="c-darkAccent">We’ve lived that isolating scenario, so we build search strategies that help therapists connect with clients at the moment they’re seeking your support.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="28/2/32/10" d="19/15/22/24" z={4}>
      <h3><span class="c-darkAccent">When your practice shows up clearly for the exact services you offer, clients arrive aligned, committed, and ready to begin. </span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Button m="32/2/34/10" d="22/15/24/21" z={4} align="center" href="/results" position="left" stretch={false} noFill>See our results</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" bg={{ src: blueIvoryPurpleCorners, overlay: 0.15 }} grid={{ rows: [79, 27], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/4/10" d="1/9/5/19" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center">Think of us as a <span class="c-lightAccent">tx plan</span> for your practice.</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="4/2/7/10" d="5/8/7/20" z={2}>
      <p class="large ta-center">Whether you need an hour consultation, an ongoing search partnership, or something in between, we’ve got what you need to grow.&nbsp;</p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="8/2/25/10" d="8/3/18/14" z={3} align="center" anim={{ origin: '0% 50%', animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.3, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.2, frames: [{ sx: 0.98 }] }] }} origin="0% 50%" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="8/2/14/10" d="8/3/18/7" z={12} zm={16} align="center" src={jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios68} alt="A smiling woman with shoulder-length wavy brown hair, dressed in a black button-up dress with rolled sleeves and a belt, standing against a plain light-colored background." focal="48.8% 15.2%" radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="15/3/22/9" d="9/8/15/13" z={4}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">SEO Power Hour</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">A one-hour consultation with an SEO expert tailored specifically to your therapy practice. Bring any and all search-related questions, walk away with actionable answers. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="22/3/24/9" d="15/8/17/13" z={8} zm={11} align="center" href="/seo-power-hour">Book Your Session</Button>
    <Shape m="26/2/43/10" d="18/3/28/14" z={4} zm={7} align="center" anim={{ origin: '0% 50%', animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.3, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.2, frames: [{ sx: 0.98 }] }] }} origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--mauve)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="26/2/32/10" d="18/3/28/7" z={11} zm={15} align="center" src={img47} alt="A man and woman in a casual office or home setting, the woman seated on a couch holding a tablet, the man standing leaning over her with a coffee cup, a coffee cup on the table, and a plate of croissants in front of the woman." radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="33/3/39/9" d="19/8/24/13" z={6} zm={8}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Digital PR&nbsp;</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Targeted, digital media features that signal credibility and boost your online reputation with clients <em>and</em> search engines sizing up your web presence. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="40/3/42/9" d="25/8/27/13" z={10} zm={13} align="center" href="/digital-pr">Get visible</Button>
    <Shape m="44/2/62/10" d="8/14/18/25" z={4} zm={5} align="center" anim={{ origin: '0% 50%', animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.3, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.2, frames: [{ sx: 0.98 }] }] }} origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--darkAccent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="44/2/50/10" d="8/14/18/18" z={12} zm={17} align="center" src={img1De7cab32} alt="A glass coffee table with a wooden base, placed on a white shag rug in a living room. The table has a black desk lamp, a stack of magazines, some white books, and a small brown vase." radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="51/3/58/9" d="9/19/15/24" z={5} zm={6}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Done-for-you SEO &amp; AEO</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Done-for-you search strategy, implementation and monitoring that ensures you’re visible <em>everywhere</em> aligned clients are looking.&nbsp;</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="59/3/61/9" d="15/19/17/24" z={9} zm={12} align="center" href="/done-for-you-seo-aeo" btnClass="btn--hover-cream">Fill Your Caseload</Button>
    <Shape m="63/2/80/10" d="18/14/28/25" z={5} zm={9} align="center" anim={{ origin: '0% 50%', animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.3, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.2, frames: [{ sx: 0.98 }] }] }} origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--accent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="63/2/69/10" d="18/14/28/18" z={13} zm={18} align="center" src={img44} alt="Person with tattoos working on a laptop at a desk, with a blue shirt and office supplies around." radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="70/3/76/9" d="19/19/24/24" z={7} zm={10}>
      <h3>Paid Google Ads&nbsp;</h3>
      <p>Keep your practice top-of-mind, and top-of-search, by pairing paid ads with a proven organic search strategy to grow your caseload, fast.</p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="77/3/79/9" d="25/19/27/24" z={10} zm={14} align="center" href="/paid-google-ads">Start Growing</Button>
  </Section>

  <Testimonials theme="dark" padding={[6.6, 6.6]} title="<p>Results you can measure, a team you can trust.&nbsp;</p>"
    items={[
      { quote: 'Before working with HelloSEO, we had a decent foundation for our website in our local market, but we knew we wanted to expand our reach to new locations. They\'ve helped us narrow down target markets that align with our brand and goals, provided thoughtful suggestions for our website, and implemented these updates. We are excited to see the data over the next few months', author: '– SARAH M.' },
      { quote: 'Jade was very informative, professional, and genuinely engaged throughout the process. She explained things clearly, asked thoughtful questions, and brought an insightful, forward-thinking approach that made me feel like we had a real strategy instead of guesswork. I left our conversations feeling informed, supported, and excited about the next steps.', author: '– DAVID S.' },
      { quote: 'Working with Jade was a great experience. As a first-time founder, it is impossible to know and understand everything. Jade was very thorough and thoughtful in her explanations and was always open to questions that came up.', author: '– JULIA D.' },
      { quote: 'Jade from HelloSEO truly cares about the success, mission, vision, and values of the business. She won’t take shortcuts to drive traffic - she will find the connections that truly elevate the brand’s awareness, and drive those home.', author: '– ABBEY G.' },
      { quote: 'Working with HelloSEO was a fantastic experience. They delivered high-quality content that saved me time and elevated my brand. I’m so grateful for their support and would highly recommend them to anyone looking to grow their business through strategic content.', author: '– NICOLE M.' }
    ]}
  />

  <Section theme="bright" height="small" grid={{ rows: [32, 19], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="1/2/15/10" d="2/4/19/13" z={2} zm={1} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: -2 }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios37} alt="A woman with long brown hair, wearing a navy blue blouse with white embroidery, gold jewelry, and earrings, sitting on a brown chair in front of brown curtains, smiling at the camera." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 38vw" />
    <Img m="11/1/16/4" d="13/3/18/6" z={6} zm={5} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 2, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={gradient4e63635d} alt="Illustration of a smiling, white, cartoon cat with closed eyes, on a purple background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 38vw, 13vw" />
    <Text m="16/2/18/10" d="3/14/8/24" z={3} zm={2} alignM="center">
      <h2>Meet Founder <span class="c-lightAccent">Jade Pruett</span>, mental health advocate and SEO expert:</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="18/2/30/10" d="8/14/15/24" z={4} zm={3} align="center" alignM="start">
      <p>We speak fluent therapist because we’ve lived alongside your profession for years. Jade’s husband is a therapist. Her closest friends are therapists. She's spent over a decade absorbing your world across dinner tables, industry events, and years of meaningful sessions as a client herself.</p>
      <p>Add 6+ years advancing SEO and AEO for therapists through HelloSEO, and you get a rare combination:<strong> award-winning search expertise with firsthand respect for your work. </strong>Think of us as a tech-savvy friend with insider understanding of your space and outside expertise to drive the discovery you need.</p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="30/2/32/10" d="16/14/18/20" z={5} zm={4} align="center" href="/meet-the-team">Learn more</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" inset divider={{ height: '2vw', concave: true }} grid={{ rows: [20, 19], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/19/10" d="2/2/19/26" z={1} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #d34320', radius: '34px' }} src={img43} alt="A person working on a laptop placed on a wooden table." radius="30px" overlay={{ opacity: 1, color: 'hsl(var(--black-hsl) / 0.65)' }} parallax={{ intensity: 20, rotation: 45, zoomStart: 2 }} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" />
    <Text m="3/3/14/9" d="5/8/13/20" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">Get a</span><span class="c-accent"> Free Assessment</span><span class="c-white"> of Your Current Visibility through our SEO Report Card!</span></h2>
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-white">We’ll review your current website and show you exactly how it’s performing in Google and AI search with specific recommendations to boost your visibility. It’s easy, fast, and FREE!</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="15/3/17/9" d="14/10/16/18" z={3} align="center" href="/seo-report-card">Get Your Free SEO Report Card</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
